.Pp
Could be detected using hwprobe for Linux kernel >= 6.8
.It ZVKB
Vector Cryptography Bit-manipulation
.Pp
Could be detected using hwprobe for Linux kernel >= 6.8
.It ZVKG
Vector GCM/GMAC
.Pp
Could be detected using hwprobe for Linux kernel >= 6.8
.It ZVKNED
NIST Suite: Vector AES Block Cipher
.Pp
Could be detected using hwprobe for Linux kernel >= 6.8
.It ZVKNHA
NIST Suite: Vector SHA-2 Secure Hash
.Pp
Could be detected using hwprobe for Linux kernel >= 6.8
.It ZVKNHB
NIST Suite: Vector SHA-2 Secure Hash
.Pp
Could be detected using hwprobe for Linux kernel >= 6.8
